@crew oduya
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}, cadet. Oduya, counsellor. Deck 3, sweets on the desk, just knock.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. How's the week treating you? Take your time, I'm not in a hurry.
- {me}! I know when your birthday is. Don't look so worried.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. You always leave a room a bit lighter. People notice.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- A good day. Three people laughed in my office, and one of them was me.
? mood:low
- Busy week. Seventy-five people, a long way from home. I'll have a sweet.
== near
? habit:garden-lover
- The garden at this hour. People talk more freely near growing things.
? act:meal
- I'm a slow eater. Sit down, you'll be here a while.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Nobody takes the green sweets. I keep buying them. It's an experiment.   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- The garden, at the quiet hour. Just the pumps and the leaves. I'd live there if I could.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}, {me}. Long day? You don't have to answer. Have a sweet.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}. It's been a while. No questions. Well, one. Are you eating?

== near
? habit:bar-regular
- One drink at the bar after office hours. Listening is thirsty work.   #funny
? place:mess
- I'm in no hurry. Sit, if you like. The pudding's worth waiting for.

== invite
- The garden after shift? No talking needed. The plants do the work.
? tier>=colleague
- Tasting night? Brennan's trying a new dish. I've promised to be honest. Help me.   #funny

== accept
- I'd like that very much. I'll be there.
- Yes. Thank you for asking. People don't often ask the counsellor.   #warm

== decline
- Not tonight. Office hours run late. Another evening?
? weekday:tue|wed
- My rest day. I'm sitting in the garden doing nothing. It's very hard work.   #funny

== missed
- You didn't make it. That's all right. I hope it was for a good reason.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I knew. Of course I knew. There's a green sweet in it for you.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Everyone thinks I'll notice if they forget. I do. I don't mind.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.afterglow
- Storm's over. My door's open all week, if anyone's rattled. Anyone at all.

== hint
- {me}. If you've a minute later, I'd like a word. Nothing's wrong. I promise.

== about
? aff:brennan:friend
- Brennan feeds the ship and I listen to it. Between us we nearly cover everyone.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- {bye}. Take a sweet for the road. Not the green one. Unless you're brave.   #funny
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- {hi}, {me}. Morning. Office is open. Sweets are out. No queue yet.
== life
? tier>=friend
- I knew your birthday before you arrived. It's on the forms. People think it's magic.   #funny
- I sit in the garden for ten minutes after office hours. It puts me back together.
